WEBVTT

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:31.080
OT: What inspires me
these days are immigrants.

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:36.256
Immigrants all over the world
who are doing the best that they can

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:40.736
to make a living,
to survive and also to thrive.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:44.016
Right now there are
over 244 million people

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:46.320
who aren't living
in their country of origin.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:50.800
This is a 40 percent increase
since the year 2000.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:53.096
So what this tells me

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:57.800
is that the disparities across the globe
are only getting worse.

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:03.616
Yet there are people who are finding
the strength and wherewithal to travel,